# R3lentless-Grind Design System (RGDS) — Cursor Rules (mandatory)

This file mirrors the repo-root `.cursorrules` for agents working inside `docs/design/m3/`.
The AI enforces the **R3lentless-Grind Design System (RGDS)** standards.
See also: `D:\github\agentcore-control-plane\.cursor\rules\design-system-m3.mdc`.

## Token scopes (components bind only to system + approved custom)

- Colors: `md.sys.color.*` (+ theme `data-theme`)
- Typography: `md.sys.typescale.*`
- Spacing: `md.sys.spacing.*`
- Shape: `md.sys.shape.corner.*`
- Custom featured: `md.custom.rainbowPulse` / `.md-rainbow-pulse` (Theme 4 only)
- Icons: `--md-custom-icon-a|b|c` (featured) or `md.sys.color.primary` (utility)

## Preview

Open `preview.html` and toggle all four themes. Theme 4 featured cards must show live rainbow pulse.

## Bifrost

Use Figma MCP through `agentcore-gateway` for validation. Do not register this folder as a Bifrost MCP upstream.
